function installMenuButton(){const menu=$('menu');if(!menu||$('ndwMenuButton'))return;const card=menu.querySelector('.menucard')||menu;const ref=[...card.querySelectorAll('button')].find(b=>b.textContent.includes('CUSTOM LEVEL EDITOR'));const b=document.createElement('button');b.id='ndwMenuButton';b.className='ghost';b.style.marginTop='10px';b.innerHTML='🌐 NEON WORKSHOP <span style="color:#5effc8">COMMUNITY</span>';b.onclick=openWorkshop;if(ref)ref.parentNode.insertBefore(b,ref);else card.appendChild(b);}
function installEditorPublishButtons(){try{const e=$('editor');if(e&&!$('ndwEditorPublish')){const row=e.querySelector('#edSaved')||e.querySelector('.menucard');const b=document.createElement('button');b.id='ndwEditorPublish';b.className='ghost';b.style.marginTop='10px';b.textContent='🌐 PUBLISH CURRENT LEVEL';b.onclick=()=>openPublish(edMode==='battle'?'battle':'race');row.parentNode.insertBefore(b,row);}const st=$('studio');if(st&&!$('ndwStudioPublish')){const card=st.querySelector('.menucard')||st;const b=document.createElement('button');b.id='ndwStudioPublish';b.className='ghost';b.textContent='🌐 PUBLISH CURVE TRACK';b.onclick=()=>openPublish('curve');card.appendChild(b);}}catch(e){console.warn(e);}}
function installOnlineButton(){try{const body=$('onlineBody');if(body&&!$('ndwOnlineOpen')){const b=document.createElement('button');b.id='ndwOnlineOpen';b.className='online-small-btn ghost';b.textContent='🌐 WORKSHOP';b.onclick=openWorkshop;body.prepend(b);}}catch(e){}}
function installFinishPanel(){const f=$('finish');if(!f)return;const card=f.querySelector('.menucard');if(!card)return;let p=$('ndwFinishPanel');if(!p){p=document.createElement('div');p.id='ndwFinishPanel';p.className='ndw-finishpanel';const toMenu=$('toMenuBtn');if(toMenu)card.insertBefore(p,toMenu);else card.appendChild(p);}if(lastPlayed){p.style.display='block';p.innerHTML='<h3>COMMUNITY CREATION · '+esc(lastPlayed.title)+'</h3><div class="ndw-actions"><button id="ndwFinishLike">♥ LIKE</button><button id="ndwFinishSave" class="ghost">SAVE</button><button id="ndwFinishFollow" class="ghost">FOLLOW CREATOR</button>'+(lastPlayed.allowRemix!==false?'<button id="ndwFinishRemix" class="ghost">REMIX</button>':'')+(playQueueIndex>=0&&playQueueIndex<playQueue.length-1?'<button id="ndwFinishNext">NEXT COMMUNITY LEVEL ▶</button>':'')+'</div>';$('ndwFinishLike').onclick=()=>{event('like',lastPlayed.id,{});toast('LIKE QUEUED');};$('ndwFinishSave').onclick=()=>addFavorite(lastPlayed.id);$('ndwFinishFollow').onclick=()=>followCreator(lastPlayed.creator&&lastPlayed.creator.id,lastPlayed.creator&&lastPlayed.creator.name);const rm=$('ndwFinishRemix');if(rm)rm.onclick=()=>remix(lastPlayed);const nx=$('ndwFinishNext');if(nx)nx.onclick=queueNext;}else p.style.display='none';}
function openWorkshop(){ensureScreen();document.querySelectorAll('.screen').forEach(x=>{if(x!==screen)x.classList.add('hide');});screen.classList.remove('hide');try{document.body.classList.remove('racing');}catch(e){}selected=null;creatorView=null;render();loadCommunity(false);}
function closeWorkshop(){if(screen)screen.classList.add('hide');const m=$('menu');if(m){m.classList.remove('hide');try{if(typeof renderMenu==='function')renderMenu();}catch(e){}}}

function restoreQueue(){const q=jread('nd_workshop_play_queue_v1',null);if(q&&Array.isArray(q.items)){playQueue=q.items.map(byId).filter(Boolean);playQueueIndex=clamp(q.index,0,Math.max(0,playQueue.length-1));}}
let ndwLastFallAt=0;function recordFall(k){if(!lastPlayed||!k)return;ndwMatchFalls++; const now=Date.now();if(now-ndwLastFallAt<850)return;ndwLastFallAt=now;event('fall',lastPlayed.id,{x:Math.round((Number(k.x)||0)/100)*100,z:Math.round((Number(k.z)||0)/100)*100});}
function hookGame(){try{if(typeof renderMenu==='function'&&!renderMenu.__ndw){const base=renderMenu;renderMenu=function(){const r=base.apply(this,arguments);installMenuButton();installEditorPublishButtons();installOnlineButton();return r;};renderMenu.__ndw=true;}
 if(typeof finishGame==='function'&&!finishGame.__ndw){const base=finishGame;finishGame=function(){const before=performance.now();const r=base.apply(this,arguments);setTimeout(()=>{try{let won=false,time=(performance.now()-startTime)/1000;if(typeof player!=='undefined'&&typeof karts!=='undefined'){const ranked=[...karts].sort((a,b)=>(b.prog||0)-(a.prog||0));won=ranked.indexOf(player)===0;}recordFinish(won,time);evaluateActiveChallenge(won,time);installFinishPanel();}catch(e){}},0);return r;};finishGame.__ndw=true;}
 if(typeof finishBattle==='function'&&!finishBattle.__ndw){const base=finishBattle;finishBattle=function(){const r=base.apply(this,arguments);setTimeout(()=>{try{let won=false;if(typeof player!=='undefined'&&typeof karts!=='undefined'){if(typeof teamModeActive==='function'&&teamModeActive())won=(typeof teamStandings==='function'&&teamStandings().findIndex(x=>x.team===player.team)===0);else{const p=$('finalPos');won=!!p&&parseInt(p.textContent,10)===1;}}{const t=(performance.now()-startTime)/1000;recordFinish(won,t);evaluateActiveChallenge(won,t);}installFinishPanel();}catch(e){}},0);return r;};finishBattle.__ndw=true;}
 if(typeof eliminate==='function'&&!eliminate.__ndw){const base=eliminate;eliminate=function(k){try{if(typeof player!=='undefined'&&k===player)recordFall(k);}catch(e){}return base.apply(this,arguments);};eliminate.__ndw=true;}
 if(typeof raceRespawn==='function'&&!raceRespawn.__ndw){const base=raceRespawn;raceRespawn=function(k){try{if(typeof player!=='undefined'&&k===player)recordFall(k);}catch(e){}return base.apply(this,arguments);};raceRespawn.__ndw=true;}
 if(typeof renderSavedLevels==='function'&&!renderSavedLevels.__ndw){const base=renderSavedLevels;renderSavedLevels=function(){const r=base.apply(this,arguments);setTimeout(installEditorPublishButtons,0);return r;};renderSavedLevels.__ndw=true;}
 if(typeof renderStudioSaved==='function'&&!renderStudioSaved.__ndw){const base=renderStudioSaved;renderStudioSaved=function(){const r=base.apply(this,arguments);setTimeout(installEditorPublishButtons,0);return r;};renderStudioSaved.__ndw=true;}
}catch(e){console.warn('Neon Workshop hooks',e);}}
function boot(){ensureScreen();installMenuButton();installEditorPublishButtons();installOnlineButton();hookGame();loadCommunity(false);setInterval(()=>{installMenuButton();installEditorPublishButtons();installOnlineButton();},2500);}
window.NDWorkshop={version:VERSION,open:openWorkshop,close:closeWorkshop,refresh:()=>loadCommunity(true),publish:openPublish,publishCurrent:()=>openPublish(typeof edMode!=='undefined'&&edMode==='battle'?'battle':'race'),publishCar:()=>openPublish('car'),publishGhost:()=>openPublish('ghost'),publishReplay:()=>openPublish('replay'),publishScenery:()=>openPublish('scenery'),sync:syncEvents,decode:decodeCode,play:c=>playCreation(typeof c==='string'?byId(c):c),catalog:()=>deep(catalog),captureCover:coverCapture,showcase:openShowcase,queue:eventQueue,lastCode:()=>lastGeneratedCode,showLastCode:()=>{if(lastGeneratedCode)showManualCode('LAST GITHUB CODE',lastGeneratedCode,lastGeneratedIssueTitle,'This is the most recently generated Workshop code.');else toast('NO CODE HAS BEEN GENERATED YET',true);}};
